id=volte_fw
name=VoLTE + VoWiFi (IMS) framework patch
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=Bastet
description=Patches CarrierConfigManager defaults (carrier_volte_available_bool, carrier_wfc_ims_available_bool, carrier_default_wfc_ims_enabled_bool, carrier_wfc_supports_wifi_only_bool = true) and applies per-boot runtime state (persist.vendor.mtk.wfc.enable, siminfo wfc_ims_*, settings, carrier config overrides) for MTK IMS VoLTE + VoWiFi on AOSP-based GSI.
minMagisk=15000